s nearby stations from that catalog (returns ranked `station_ids`)\n3. **Finally**: `ndp_resource_resolver` stages the nearest ranked station's time-series CSV (returns `acquisition.status=staged` with `acquisition.local_path`)\n\nI have no tools of my own and no grounded knowledge of available datasets, station locations, or paths. Only my children's tool calls produce real evidence. This is a routing turn\u2014I delegate to the first child and forward the already-resolved geospatial state without inventing any acquisition, catalog, or resource_candidate facts."}}}

