st\n\nFor STEP 2, I need to stage the resource by calling `ndp_stage_resource` with the catalog URL and workspace directory, which will download the CSV file locally. Then in STEP 3, I'll use `shell_bash` to extract just the first three columns and save it as `earthscope_stations_clean.csv` in the workspace, finally updating the workflow state to point to this cleaned file."}}

