d station's time-series CSV (returns `acquisition.status=staged` with `acquisition.local_path`)\n\nI have no tools of my own and no grounded knowledge of available datasets, station locations, or paths. Only my children's tool calls produce real evidence. This is a routing turn\u2014I delegate to the first child and forward the already-resolved geospatial state without inventing any acquisition, catalog, or resource_candidate facts.", "status": "running", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "data", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "stage": "delegate.started", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "depth": 0, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react"}}, "replay": true}

