data: {"type": "message.part.completed", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:35:12.107376+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_67de8abd5b15", "message_id": "msg_asst_3bad04dabf97", "part_id": "part_1e34b55cbeb8", "stream_source": "live", "final_text": "Let me analyze this carefully. I'm being asked to follow a very specific three-step process for discovering and staging the EarthScope station metadata catalog:\n\n1. **STEP 1 - Search** (ALREADY COMPLETED in the trajectory): The search for `[\"earthscope\", \"converted\"]` with `limit: 10` returned:\n   - Dataset ID: `811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41`\n   - Dataset name: `earthscope_stations`\n   - Resource URL: `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n   - Resource name: `earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n2. **STEP 2 - Stage the catalog**: I need to call `ndp_stage_resource` with:\n   - `url`: the exact URL from step 1\n   - `output_dir`: the Active workspace root from context: `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace`\n   - NO `output_name` parameter\n\n3. **STEP 3 - Clean the CSV**: I need to call `shell_bash` with:\n   - `command`: `cut -d, -f1-3 '<RAW>' > '<WORKSPACE>/earthscope_stations_clean.csv'`\n   - Where `<RAW>` is the `local_path` from step 2\n   - Where `<WORKSPACE>` is `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace`\n\nCurrently, I've completed STEP 1 with the observation showing the search was successful. Now I need to proceed to STEP 2.\n\nThe system prompt is very strict:\n- Exactly three tool calls, no more\n- STEP 1 is done (search)\n- STEP 2 is next (stage)\n- STEP 3 is final (clean with shell_bash)\n- Must set `workflow_state.acquisition.metadata_path` to the cleaned path\n- The file must be under the workspace root, NOT /tmp\n- Do NOT call ndp_stage_resource twice\n- Do NOT finish after search+stage; must complete the shell_bash clean first\n\nFor STEP 2, I need to stage the resource by calling `ndp_stage_resource` with the catalog URL and workspace directory, which will download the CSV file locally. Then in STEP 3, I'll use `shell_bash` to extract just the first three columns and save it as `earthscope_stations_clean.csv` in the workspace, finally updating the workflow state to point to this cleaned file."}, "replay": true}

