p is **`earthscope_station_catalog`**, which must:\n- Consume the staged `acquisition.metadata_path`\n- Spatially filter the metadata to stations within the 50 km radius of the LA center\n- Rank all filtered candidates by distance to the center\n- Return `station_catalog.status=ranked` with the ranked `station_ids` and their distances\n\nThis ranking step is mandatory before `ndp_resource_resolver` can select and stage the top candidate's time-series CSV. I have no tools of my own and cannot perform spatial filtering; I must delegate this to the catalog expert."}}}

