data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:43:44.396574+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_67de8abd5b15", "message_id": "msg_asst_3bad04dabf97", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_6f027ea2fd17", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "earthscope_station_catalog", "agent_id": "earthscope_station_catalog", "question": "Filter and rank the EarthScope GNSS stations in the staged metadata catalog at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv`. Use the geospatial parameters (center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W; radius: 50 km) to spatially filter all stations within the region. Rank the filtered candidates by distance to the center point (nearest first). Return the ranked station list with station IDs, distances, and coordinates.", "thought": "The workflow has successfully completed the first stage of the required chain:\n\n1. **Geospatial resolution**: \u2713 COMPLETE. The region is resolved to Los Angeles with center coordinates (34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W) and radius 50 km.\n\n2. **NDP Dataset Discovery**: \u2713 COMPLETE. The EarthScope station metadata catalog has been discovered and staged at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv` with a metadata source URL.\n\nCurrent state shows:\n- `acquisition.metadata_path` is now populated with a staged path from `ndp_stage_resource`\n- `acquisition.status` is `metadata_only` (no time-series CSV yet)\n- `catalog.status` is `metadata_found`\n\nAccording to the required hand-off chain, the next step is **`earthscope_station_catalog`**, which must:\n- Consume the staged `acquisition.metadata_path`\n- Spatially filter the metadata to stations within the 50 km radius of the LA center\n- Rank all filtered candidates by distance to the center\n- Return `station_catalog.status=ranked` with the ranked `station_ids` and their distances\n\nThis ranking step is man