data: {"type": "message.part.completed", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:45:20.229860+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_67de8abd5b15", "message_id": "msg_asst_3bad04dabf97", "part_id": "part_113244f3d2c3", "stream_source": "live", "final_text": "Let me analyze this request carefully.\n\nI'm being asked to act as an NDP Resource Resolver Expert. Looking at the trajectory:\n\n1. The task is to stage the GNSS displacement time-series CSV for the highest-ranked candidate station\n2. The ranked list starts with MTA1, PKRD, ELSC, USC2, etc.\n3. In the trajectory:\n   - Tool 0: Searched for \"MTA1\" dataset and found it successfully\n   - Tool 1: Staged the MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv file successfully\n   - The staging returned: \n     - local_path: \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\"\n     - size_bytes: 50424246\n     - content_type: \"text/csv\"\n     - url: \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\"\n\nNow I need to determine the next step. According to the instructions:\n- I HAVE staged a station successfully (MTA1)\n- I should record it from the ndp_stage_resource result\n- Set acquisition.local_path to the returned local_path\n- Set acquisition.source_url\n- Set acquisition.size_bytes\n- Set acquisition.status=\"staged\"\n- Set analysis_ready=true\n- Set required_columns=[\\\"time\\\",\\\"east\\\",\\\"north\\\",\\\"up\\\"]\n- Set resource_candidate.station_id = the id (MTA1)\n- The question asks for \"the highest-ranked candidate from the list\" - which is MTA1\n- It says \"For the first station with an available complete time-series containing the required columns\" - we have found and staged MTA1\n\nThe request says to stage \"the highest-ranked candidate from the list\" - singular. \n\nMTA1 is the top-ranked station and we've successfully staged it with all required metadata. The task specified staging the highest-ranked candidate, which we've completed. According to the