nked by distance to center\n\n**Selected station:**\n- **Station ID:** MTA1\n- **Distance:** 0.30 km (nearest candidate)\n\n**Staged time-series data:**\n- **Local path:** `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Source URL:** `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **File size:** 50,424,246 bytes\n- **Content:** GNSS displacement time-series data\n- **Analysis status:** Ready (`analysis_ready=true`)\n\nThe staged CSV is ready for downstream visualization and analysis.", "output_summary": "\u2713 **EarthScope GNSS data acquisition complete for Los Angeles region.**\n\n**Region resolved:**\n- Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\n- Center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W\n- Search radius: 50 km\n\n**Station discovery:**\n- **Candidate count:** 72 stations identified within 50 km radius\n- **Ranking:** All candidates ranked by distance to center\n\n**Selected station:**\n- **Station ID:** MTA1\n- **Distance:** 0.30 km (nearest candidate)\n\n**Staged time-series data:**\n- **Local path:** `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Source URL:** `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **File size:** 50,424,246 bytes\n- **Content:** GNSS displacement time-series data\n\n\nThe staged CSV is ready for downstream visualization and analysis.", "output_raw": "", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"status": "staged", "metadata_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.or