 (min/max/mean) are scoped to 5000 profiled rows only; do not generalize to full 250000-row file", "Sampling cadence inferred from visible sample rows (1000 ms delta) only; full-file cadence not verified", "Time range shown is the span within the 5000 profiled rows, not the complete file duration", "Profile is scan-limited and profile-limited by design; qChannel values are opaque flags, not quality indicators", "No explicit full-file row count verification, gap checks, or noise thresholds computed"]}, "pipeline_stage": "profiling_complete"}}, "observation": "Completed.", "is_finish": true}}}

