cted in profiled sample\n- Time cadence observed at ~1,000 ms (profiled sample only)\n\nThe user's original request explicitly includes two requirements:\n1. \"Profile the staged GNSS time-series CSV...\" \u2014 \u2713 **Complete** (gnss_timeseries_analysis)\n2. \"Assess station suitability based on data completeness and quality indicators\" \u2014 \u23f3 **Pending** (requires station_network_analysis)\n\nThe request does NOT mention earthquakes, seismic events, or event catalogs, so seismic_event_catalog is not required per instructions.\n\n**Routing decision**: Delegate to station_network_analysis to assess MTA1's suitability for displacement analysis using the profiled evidence. This is the only remaining child work required to complete the user's task.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "analysis", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "analysis", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 53757, "execution_mode": "blueprint_chain_of_thought", "input": "Assess the suitability of station MTA1 for GNSS displacement analysis. The profiled MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv data shows: complete required columns (time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel), 250,000 rows with 5,000 profiled rows, observed ~1,000 ms cadence in profiled sample, uncertainty levels sigEE/sigNN ~0.033 m and sigUU ~0.065 m (profiled sample), and zero missing values in profiled rows. Evaluate station and network suitability based on data completeness, column presence, uncertainty ranges, and other quality indicators relevant to displacement analysis. Report suitability status and any limitations.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n**Interim Summary: MTA1 GNSS Profile Complete, Suitability Assessment Pending**\n\nThe staged MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv time-series has been profiled successfully:\n\n**Profile Status**: Complete (scan-limited)\n- File: 50.4 MB; 250,000 rows; 5,000 rows profiled\n- Columns: All 8 required present (time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel)\n- **Displacement statistics (profiled rows only)**:\n  - East: min/max/mean = \u22120.07 / \u22120.03 / \u22120.047 m\n  - North: min/max/mean = 0.029 / 0.058 / 0.045 m\n  - Up: min/max/mean = 0.051 / 0.224 / 0.136 m\n- **Uncertainty statistics (profiled rows only)**:\n  - Horizontal (sigEE/sigNN): ~0.033 m mean\n  - Vertical (sigUU): ~0.065 m mean\n- **Time information (profiled sample)**: Observed cadence ~1,000 ms; profiled span ~5,070 seconds\n- **Missing values**: 0 detected in profiled rows\n\n**Profile Caveats**: Numeric summaries, time range, and cadence findings are limited to 5,000-row sample; full-file statistics and gap analysis not performed. No noise assessment or quality-threshold interpretation applied. qChannel values present but not decoded.\n\n**Next step**: Station suitability assessment is now pending from station_network_analysis expert.\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"metadata_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"source_url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lo