data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:51:34.002589+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_67de8abd5b15", "message_id": "msg_asst_3bad04dabf97", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_713a49168858", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "station_network_analysis", "agent_id": "station_network_analysis", "question": "Assess the suitability of station MTA1 for GNSS displacement analysis. The profiled MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv data shows: complete required columns (time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel), 250,000 rows with 5,000 profiled rows, observed ~1,000 ms cadence in profiled sample, uncertainty levels sigEE/sigNN ~0.033 m and sigUU ~0.065 m (profiled sample), and zero missing values in profiled rows. Evaluate station and network suitability based on data completeness, column presence, uncertainty ranges, and other quality indicators relevant to displacement analysis. Report suitability status and any limitations.", "thought": "The gnss_timeseries_analysis expert has completed profiling of the MTA1 GNSS time-series CSV with complete column validation and scan-limited numeric summaries. The child returned:\n- All 8 required columns present\n- 250,000 total rows; 5,000 rows profiled with statistics\n- Displacement and uncertainty statistics computed and documented with explicit caveats\n- No missing values detected in profiled sample\n- Time cadence observed at ~1,000 ms (profiled sample only)\n\nThe user's original request explicitly includes two requirements:\n1. \"Profile the staged GNSS time-series CSV...\" \u2014 \u2713 **Complete** (gnss_timeseries_analysis)\n2. \"Assess station suitability based on data completeness and quality indicators\" \u2014 \u23f3 **Pending** (requires station_network_analysis)\n\nThe request does NOT mention earthquakes, seismic events, or event catalogs, so seismic_event_catalog is not required per instructions.\n\n**Routing decision**: Delegate to station_network_a