data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:52:50.850026+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_67de8abd5b15", "message_id": "msg_asst_3bad04dabf97", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_56870122a72d", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "analysis", "agent_id": "analysis", "question": "Profile the staged GNSS time-series CSV at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv` for station MTA1. Analyze the displacement data including row count, time range, cadence, missing values, and statistical summaries of the east, north, and up displacement components. Assess station suitability based on data completeness and quality indicators.", "thought": "The user requested four steps: (1) find the nearest EarthScope GNSS station to Los Angeles, (2) stage its time-series CSV, (3) profile it, and (4) create a displacement plot.\n\nStatus:\n- \u2713 **geospatial** completed: Los Angeles region resolved to center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 50 km\n- \u2713 **data** completed: 72 stations discovered; MTA1 selected as nearest (0.30 km away); staged CSV ready at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv` with `analysis_ready=true`\n- \u2717 **analysis**: Not yet run \u2014 user explicitly asked to \"profile it\"\n- \u2717 **visualization**: Not yet run \u2014 user explicitly asked to \"create a displacement time-series plot\"\n- \u2717 **synthesis**: Not yet run \u2014 required to merge evidence into final answer\n\nPer the orchestrator instructions, a staged station CSV with `analysis_ready=true` is the trigger to continue downstream. The user's request explicitly includes profiling and plotting, so both `analysis` and `visualization` are required before `synthesis` writes the final answer.\n\nI will route to `analysis` first to profile the staged MTA1 data, then be re-invoked to route to `visualization`, then `synthesis`.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "main", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "main", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 27805, "execution_mode": "blueprint_chain_of_thought", "input": "Profile the staged GNSS time-series CSV at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv` for station MTA1. Analyze the displacement data including row count, time range, cadence, missing values, and statistical summaries of the east, north, and up displacement components. Assess station suitability based on data completeness and quality indicators.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(Awaiting profiling results from analysis expert before providing final answer.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"metadata_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"source_url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 50, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Default search radius of 50 km assumed; no explicit radius was specified in the request.\"]}, \"pipeline_stage\": \"profiling_required\", \"profile\": null, \"request_summary\": {\"geography\": \"Los Angeles\", \"requirements\": [\"station_discovery\", \"time_series_staging\", \"profiling\", \"visualization\"], \"task\": \"find_stage_profile_plot\"}, \"resource_candidate\": {\"geographically_grounded\": true, \"station_id\": \"MTA1\", \"status\": \"selected\"}, \"station_catalog\": {\"candidate_count\": 72, \"station_ids\": [\"MTA1\", \"PKRD\", \"ELSC\", \"USC2\", \"SILK\", \"OXYC\", \"P800\", \"LEE2\", \"LEEP\", \"GVRS\", \"BGIS\", \"NOPK\", \"MHMS\", \"VDCY\", \"CIT1\", \"MILK\", \"BRAN\", \"P799\", \"HOLP\", \"LFRS\", \"DYH2\", \"WNRA\", \"BKMS\", \"JPLM\", \"FCTF\", \"UCLP\", \"WRHS\", \"RHCL\", \"WHC1\", \"CSDH\", \"RHCG\", \"LONG\", \"CRHS\", \"WLSN\", \"VIMT\", \"LBC1\", \"LPHS\", \"WMAP\", \"TORP\", \"LBCH\", \"LBC2\", \"HBCO\", \"WCHS\", \"CVHS\", \"PVRS\", \"SNHS\", \"PVHS\", \"AZU1\", \"CGDM\", \"LAPC\", \"CSN1\", \"DAM3\", \"DAM2\", \"BLSA\", \"VNCX\", \"P517\", \"P587\", \"CMP9\", \"CBHS\", \"SPMS\", \"CHIL\", \"SPK1\", \"PVE3\", \"VTIS\", \"PSDM\", \"CCCS\", \"ROCK\", \"LORS\", \"SACY\", \"SKYB\", \"TWMS\", \"CLAR\"], \"status\": \"ranked\"}, \"visualization\": null}}", "output": "# GNSS Time-Series Profile & Station Suitability Summary \u2014 MTA1\n\n## Staged Data\n- **File**: `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Size**: 50,424,246 bytes\n- **Rows in file**: 250,000 total\n- **Rows profiled (numeric summaries)**: 5,000\n- **Source URL**: https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\n\n## Structure\n- **Required columns**: All 8 present \u2014 time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel \u2713\n\n## Displacement Components (Profiled Sample, 5,000 rows)\n\n| Component | Min (m)  | Max (m)  | Mean (m) |\n|-----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| East      | \u22120.070   | \u22120.030   | \u22120.0472  |\n| North     | 0.029    | 0.058    | 0.0451   |\n| Up        | 0.051    | 0.224    | 0.1358   |\n\n## Displacement Uncertainty (Profiled Sample, 5,000 rows)\n\n| Uncertainty | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) |\n|-------------|---------|---------|----------|\n| sigEE (E\u2013W) | 0.032   | 0.035   | 0.0334   |\n| sigNN (N\u2013S) | 0.032   | 0.036   | 0.0330   |\n| sigUU (Vert)| 0.062   | 0.066   | 0.0651   |\n\n## Time Coverage & Cadence (Profiled Sample)\n- **Time range**: 1,733,184,000,000 to 1,733,189,070,000 milliseconds (Unix epoch)\n- **Profiled time span**: ~5,070 seconds (~1 hour 24 minutes)\n- **Observed cadence**: ~1,000 ms between adjacent samples\n- **Caveat**: Full-file time range, complete duration, and cadence verification remain unperformed.\n\n## Data Completeness\n- **Missing values in profiled rows**: 0\n- **Caveat**: Missing-value assessment applies to profiled rows only; full-file gap analysis not performed.\n\n## Station Suitability (Preliminary, Scan-Limited)\n- **Structure**: All required columns intact in profiled sample \u2713\n- **Uncertainty scale**: Horizontal (~0.033 m) and vertical (~0.065 m) uncertainty values span centimeter-to-decimeter range, consistent with typical GNSS instrument precision.\n- **Geospatial context**: Station MTA1 is one of 72 candidates in Los Angeles area network (bbox: \u2212118.67\u00b0 to \u2212118.16\u00b0W, 33.66\u00b0 to 34.34\u00b0N).\n- **Preliminary status**: Structurally sound; suitable for preliminary analysis pending full-file verification.\n\n## Critical Limitations\n\n1. **Statistics scope**: Min/max/mean values are from 5,000 profiled rows only; do not generalize to the full 250,000-row file.\n2. **Time and cadence**: Time range and observed cadence describe the profiled sample; full-file duration and complete-scan cadence verification remain unverified.\n3. **Missing-value assessment**: Counts apply to profiled rows only; no full-file continuity or gap-pattern analysis performed.\n4. **Quality flags**: qChannel metadata is present but not decoded; no quality-threshold interpretation supplied.\n5. **Noise and continuity**: No per-epoch noise assessment, data continuity checks, or quality thresholds applied.\n6. **Partial profiling**: Profile is scan-limited and partial by design; full-file statistical confirmation is needed before production-grade analysis.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nMTA1 data structure and sampled statistics support displacement work. However, full-file profiling (cadence verification, gap analysis, complete time-range confirmation, and continuity checks) is required to confirm suitability for production analysis. Parallel evaluation of network redundancy across the 72-station Los Angeles catalog is recommended to validate results and mitigate single-station risk.", "output_summary": "# GNSS Time-Series Profile & Station Suitability Summary \u2014 MTA1\n\n## Staged Data\n- **File**: `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Size**: 50,424,246 bytes\n- **Rows in file**: 250,000 total\n- **Rows profiled (numeric summaries)**: 5,000\n- **Source URL**: https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\n\n## Structure\n- **Required columns**: All 8 present \u2014 time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel \u2713\n\n## Displacement Components (Profiled Sample, 5,000 rows)\n\n| Component | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) |\n|-----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| East | \u22120.070 | \u22120.030 | \u22120.0472 |\n| North | 0.029 | 0.058 | 0.0451 |\n| Up | 0.051 | 0.224 | 0.1358 |\n\n## Displacement Uncertainty (Profiled Sample, 5,000 rows)\n\n| Uncertainty | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) |\n|-------------|---------|---------|----------|\n| sigEE (E\u2013W) | 0.032 | 0.035 | 0.0334 |\n| sigNN (N\u2013S) | 0.032 | 0.036 | 0.0330 |\n| sigUU (Vert)| 0.062 | 0.066 | 0.0651 |\n\n## Time Coverage & Cadence (Profiled Sample)\n- **Time range**: 1,733,184,000,000 to 1,733,189,070,000 milliseconds (Unix epoch)\n- **Profiled time span**: ~5,070 seconds (~1 hour 24 minutes)\n- **Observed cadence**: ~1,000 ms between adjacent samples\n- **Caveat**: Full-file time range, complete duration, and cadence verification remain unperformed.\n\n## Data Completeness\n- **Missing values in profiled rows**: 0\n- **Caveat**: Missing-value assessment applies to profiled rows only; full-file gap analysis not performed.\n\n## Station Suitability (Preliminary, Scan-Limited)\n- **Structure**: All required columns intact in profiled sample \u2713\n- **Uncertainty scale**: Horizontal (~0.033 m) and vertical (~0.065 m) uncertainty values span centimeter-to-decimeter range, consistent with typical GNSS instrument precision.\n- **Geospatial context**: Station MTA1 is one of 72 candidates in Los Angeles area network (bbox: \u2212118.67\u00b0 to \u2212118.16\u00b0W, 33.66\u00b0 to 34.34\u00b0N).\n- **Preliminary status**: Structurally sound; suitable for preliminary analysis pending full-file verification.\n\n## Critical Limitations\n\n1. **Statistics scope**: Min/max/mean values are from 5,000 profiled rows only; do not generalize to the full 250,000-row file.\n2. **Time and cadence**: Time range and observed cadence describe the profiled sample; full-file duration and complete-scan cadence verification remain unverified.\n3. **Missing-value assessment**: Counts apply to profiled rows only; no full-file continuity or gap-pattern analysis performed.\n4. **Quality flags**: qChannel metadata is present but not decoded; no quality-threshold interpretation supplied.\n5. **Noise and continuity**: No per-epoch noise assessment, data continuity checks, or quality thresholds applied.\n6. **Partial profiling**: Profile is scan-limited and partial by design; full-file statistical confirmation is needed before production-grade analysis.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nMTA1 data structure and sampled statistics support displacement work. However, full-file profiling (cadence verification, gap analysis, complete time-range confirmation, and continuity checks) is required to confirm suitability for production analysis. Parallel evaluation of network redundancy across the 72-station Los Angeles catalog is recommended to validate results and mitigate single-station risk.", "output_raw": "", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "metadata_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246, "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "status": "staged"}, "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 50, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved", "warnings": ["Default search radius of 50 km assumed; no explicit radius was specified in the request."]}, "pipeline_stage": "network_analysis_complete", "profile": {"status": "complete", "path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "scan_limited": true, "columns": ["time", "east", "north", "up", "sigEE", "sigNN", "sigUU", "qChannel"], "limitations": ["Numeric statistics computed on 5,000 profiled rows only; do not generalize to full 250,000-row file", "Time range and cadence observed in profiled sample only; full-file duration and cadence not verified", "Missing-value analysis scoped to profiled rows only; no full-file gap analysis performed", "No noise assessment, continuity checks, or data quality thresholds applied", "Profile is scan-limited by design; partial profiling used for efficiency", "qChannel values are metadata flags; no decoding or quality rating supplied"], "missing_values_in_profiled_rows": 0, "observed_cadence_ms": 1000, "rows_profiled": 5000, "rows_scanned": 250000, "time_range_milliseconds": [1733184000000, 1733189070000], "time_span_seconds_profiled": 5070, "missing_values_scope": "profiled_rows"}, "request_summary": {"geography": "Los Angeles", "requirements": ["station_discovery", "time_series_staging", "profiling", "suitability_assessment"], "task": "find_stage_profile_assess"}, "resource_candidate": {"geographically_grounded": true, "station_id": "MTA1", "status": "selected", "suitability": "preliminary_scan_limited", "suitability_level": "structurally_sound_pending_full_verification", "assessment_complete": true}, "station_catalog": {"candidate_count": 72, "station_ids": ["MTA1", "PKRD", "ELSC", "USC2", "SILK", "OXYC", "P800", "LEE2", "LEEP", "GVRS", "BGIS", "NOPK", "MHMS", "VDCY", "CIT1", "MILK", "BRAN", "P799", "HOLP", "LFRS", "DYH2", "WNRA", "BKMS", "JPLM", "FCTF", "UCLP", "WRHS", "RHCL", "WHC1", "CSDH", "RHCG", "LONG", "CRHS", "WLSN", "VIMT", "LBC1", "LPHS", "WMAP", "TORP", "LBCH", "LBC2", "HBCO", "WCHS", "CVHS", "PVRS", "SNHS", "PVHS", "AZU1", "CGDM", "LAPC", "CSN1", "DAM3", "DAM2", "BLSA", "VNCX", "P517", "P587", "CMP9", "CBHS", "SPMS", "CHIL", "SPK1", "PVE3", "VTIS", "PSDM", "CCCS", "ROCK", "LORS", "SACY", "SKYB", "TWMS", "CLAR"], "status": "ranked", "network_redundancy_recommendation": "parallel_evaluation_recommended"}, "visualization": null}, "children": [{"delegate_to": "gnss_timeseries_analysis", "agent_id": "gnss_timeseries_analysis", "question": "Profile the staged GNSS CSV at D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv for station MTA1. Scan the CSV to extract: (1) total row count, (2) timestamp column and time range bounds, (3) sampling cadence/interval, (4) east, north, and up displacement columns and their numeric ranges, (5) uncertainty columns and their ranges, (6) missing value counts, scope, and affected columns, (7) numeric summaries (min, max, mean, standard deviation) for each displacement component scanned. Report only rows_scanned, columns found, numeric ranges, and explicit limitations\u2014do not infer full-file cadence, duration, or quality from partial scan. Return all findings in workflow_state.profile with status and any caveats about incomplete or scan-limited verification.", "thought": "The staged GNSS CSV acquisition for station MTA1 is marked `analysis_ready=true` with `status=staged` and a valid local path provided. However, the `profile` field is currently `null`, indicating no profiling has been performed yet. Per the workflow orchestration rules, I have no tools of my own and must delegate to child experts. The logical first step is to route to the `gnss_timeseries_analysis` child expert, which holds the `pandas_profile_csv` tool and can examine the actual CSV file to produce grounded evidence on row count, time range, cadence, missing values, and displacement component statistics. Only after receiving that child's typed workflow state can I route to network analysis and produce a final answer. I must not fabricate any file paths, station facts, or data summaries from prior knowledge.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "analysis", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "analysis", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 84369, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Profile the staged GNSS CSV at D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv for station MTA1. Scan the CSV to extract: (1) total row count, (2) timestamp column and time range bounds, (3) sampling cadence/interval, (4) east, north, and up displacement columns and their numeric ranges, (5) uncertainty columns and their ranges, (6) missing value counts, scope, and affected columns, (7) numeric summaries (min, max, mean, standard deviation) for each displacement component scanned. Report only rows_scanned, columns found, numeric ranges, and explicit limitations\u2014do not infer full-file cadence, duration, or quality from partial scan. Return all findings in workflow_state.profile with status and any caveats about incomplete or scan-limited verification.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\nProfiling workflow initiated. Delegating to `gnss_timeseries_analysis` child expert to profile the staged GNSS CSV. Awaiting tool-grounded evidence on time-series structure, displacement columns, row count, time bounds, cadence, missing values, and numeric summaries for station MTA1 before proceeding to network suitability assessment and final answer.\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"metadata_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"source_url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"c