data: {"type": "message.part.completed", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:53:05.625149+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_67de8abd5b15", "message_id": "msg_asst_3bad04dabf97", "part_id": "part_d5255014ef89", "stream_source": "live", "final_text": "Let me analyze this orchestrator request carefully.\n\n## Context Summary:\n1. The user's original request: \"Find the nearest EarthScope GNSS station to Los Angeles, stage its time-series CSV, profile it, and create a displacement time-series plot.\"\n\n2. Work already completed:\n   - **geospatial**: Resolved Los Angeles to coordinates (center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius: 50 km)\n   - **data**: Discovered 72 stations, selected nearest (MTA1, 0.30 km away), staged CSV at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n   - **analysis**: Profiled the staged CSV (5,000 rows scanned from 250,000 total), reported displacement statistics, uncertainties, and limitations\n\n3. Work remaining:\n   - **visualization**: Create a displacement time-series plot (PNG)\n   - **synthesis**: Write the final user-facing answer\n\n## Decision Logic:\nThe user request explicitly asked for:\n1. \u2705 Find nearest station \u2192 Done (geospatial + data)\n2. \u2705 Stage CSV \u2192 Done (data)\n3. \u2705 Profile it \u2192 Done (analysis)\n4. \u274c Create displacement plot \u2192 NOT YET DONE (needs visualization)\n\nThe workflow_state shows:\n- `visualization: null` \u2014 visualization has NOT been run yet\n- `profile.status: complete` \u2014 analysis is complete\n- `acquisition.status: staged` \u2014 data is ready\n- All required child results are typed in the workflow_state\n\nThe instruction is clear: \"Asks to PLOT / chart / visualize displacement \u2192 also run `visualization`\" and \"Asks for the full study... \u2192 run the whole pipeline.\"\n\nThis request asks for a plot, so I MUST route to `visualization` next to create the PNG artifact before `synthesis` writes the final answer.\n \nThree of the five child tasks have completed and provided evidence. The user's request explicitly calls for a displacement time-series plot, which means visualization must run next. The staged CSV and profile results are both ready to serve as inputs. I'll delegate to visualization to generate the plot artifact, then synthesis can finalize the response.\n\n**reasoning**: The visualization child hasn't executed yet, and the user's explicit requirement for a time-series plot makes this the necessary next step.\n\n**answer**: Holding empty pending delegation\n\n**workflow_state**: Preserving accumulated evidence from completed children\n\n**next_expert**: `visualization`\n\n**next_task**: Generate a PNG showing displacement over time from the staged MTA1 CSV using profile data\n\n**completed**: Will mark upon sending this response"}}

