data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:53:19.671532+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_67276718f60744a6", "event_type": "expert.lifecycle.started", "session_id": "sess_e42cacfaef9d", "workspace_id": "ws_ndp_demo", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_67de8abd5b15", "turn_id": "msg_user_67de8abd5b15", "span_id": "sem_67276718f60744a6", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "running", "summary": "expert visualization started", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:53:19.517587+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "visualization", "role": "expert"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {}, "provider": {}, "payload": {"expert_id": "visualization", "expert_span_id": "d333103ae4c14a83", "input": {"question": "Create a PNG displacement time-series plot from the staged MTA1 station CSV (D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv). Plot east, north, and up displacement components over time as line series with legends and axis labels. Include the observed cadence (1,000 ms) and profiled time span (~1 hour 24 minutes) in plot metadata or title.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\nRouting to visualization expert to generate the displacement time-series plot from the staged MTA1 data.\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"metadata_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"source_url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 50, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Default search radius of 50 km assumed; no explicit radius was specified in the request.\"]}, \"pipeline_stage\": \"network_analysis_complete\", \"profile\": {\"columns\": [\"time\", \"east\", \"north\", \"up\", \"sigEE\", \"sigNN\", \"sigUU\", \"qChannel\"], \"limitations\": [\"Numeric statistics computed on 5,000 profiled rows only; do not generalize to full 250,000-row file\", \"Time range and cadence observed in profiled sample only; full-file duration and cadence not verified\", \"Missing-value analysis scoped to profiled rows only; no full-file gap analysis performed\", \"No noise assessment, continuity checks, or data quality thresholds applied\", \"Profile is scan-limited by design; partial profiling used for efficiency\", \"qChannel values are metadata flags; no decoding or quality rating supplied\"], \"missing_values_in_profiled_rows\": 0, \"missing_values_scope\": \"profiled_rows\", \"observed_cadence_ms\": 1000, \"path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"rows_profiled\": 5000, \"rows_scanned\": 250000, \"scan_limited\": true, \"status\": \"complete\", \"time_range_milliseconds\": [1733184000000, 1733189070000], \"time_span_seconds_profiled\": 5070}, \"request_summary\": {\"geography\": \"Los Angeles\", \"requirements\": [\"station_discovery\", \"time_series_staging\", \"profiling\", \"suitability_assessment\", \"visualization\"], \"task\": \"find_stage_profile_assess_plot\"}, \"resource_candidate\": {\"assessment_complete\": true, \"geographically_grounded\": true, \"station_id\": \"MTA1\", \"status\": \"selected\", \"suitability\": \"preliminary_scan_limited\", \"suitability_level\": \"structurally_sound_pending_full_verification\"}, \"station_catalog\": {\"candidate_count\": 72, \"network_redundancy_recommendation\": \"parallel_evaluation_recommended\", \"station_ids\": [\"MTA1\", \"PKRD\", \"ELSC\", \"USC2\", \"SILK\", \"OXYC\", \"P800\", \"LEE2\", \"LEEP\", \"GVRS\", \"BGIS\", \"NOPK\", \"MHMS\", \"VDCY\", \"CIT1\", \"MILK\", \"BRAN\", \"P799\", \"HOLP\", \"LFRS\", \"DYH2\", \"WNRA\", \"BKMS\", \"JPLM\", \"FCTF\", \"UCLP\", \"WRHS\", \"RHCL\", \"WHC1\", \"CSDH\", \"RHCG\", \"LONG\", \"CRHS\", \"WLSN\", \"VIMT\", \"LBC1\", \"LPHS\", \"WMAP\", \"TORP\", \"LBCH\", \"LBC2\", \"HBCO\", \"WCHS\", \"CVHS\", \"PVRS\", \"SNHS\", \"PVHS\", \"AZU1\", \"CGDM\", \"LAPC\", \"CSN1\", \"DAM3\", \"DAM2\", \"BLSA\", \"VNCX\", \"P517\", \"P587\", \"CMP9\", \"CBHS\", \"SPMS\", \"CHIL\", \"SPK1\", \"PVE3\", \"VTIS\", \"PSDM\", \"CCCS\", \"ROCK\", \"LORS\", \"SACY\", \"SKYB\", \"TWMS\", \"CLAR\"], \"status\": \"ranked\"}, \"visualization\": null}}", "system_prompt": "# GNSS Visualization Expert\n\nCreate a real PNG from the staged station time-series CSV(s).\n\n## The data path(s) come from workflow state \u2014 never invent them\n\nPlot the station CSV(s) the resolver staged: `acquisition.local_path`, plus every path\nin `acquisition.local_paths` when several stations were staged. These are exact\n`ndp_stage_resource` results under the Active workspace root (e.g.\n`<workspace>/P475.CI.LY_.20.csv`). Copy them verbatim \u2014 never guess, abbreviate, or\nbuild a city/region-named path (`san_diego.csv`, `<city>_stations.csv`). Only a path\nthat appeared in successful staging evidence is valid.\n\n## Discover the columns, then plot\n\nFirst call `pandas_profile_csv` on the staged CSV to learn its EXACT column names (or\nread `profile.columns` from analysis state). A GNSS file exposes a time column and\n`east`, `north`, `up`; confirm each name against the profile before using it. Pass the\nreal time column as `x_column` and the requested displacement column(s) as `y_columns`\n(default east/north/up) \u2014 only names that appear in the profile.\n\nCall `plot_plot_timeseries` with an explicit ABSOLUTE `output_path` under the Active\nworkspace root (same directory as the staged CSV, station-named, `.png`); without it\nthe artifact does not resolve to a real file and is lost. To plot ONE station, pass its\nCSV as `data_path`. To compare SEVERAL on one figure, pass the first as `data_path` and\nthe others as `overlay_paths` \u2014 the tool overlays them on shared axes, labelled per\nstation.\n\nCite the exact `output_path` the tool returns. Do not claim a figure exists unless\n`plot_plot_timeseries` succeeded with that path. A successful plot proves only that the\nselected columns were plotted for the returned rows \u2014 not full-file completeness,\ngap-free data, cadence, or low noise; do not assert those.\n\nAfter success, include parent-consumable JSON evidence:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workflow_state\": {\n    \"artifact\": {\n      \"status\": \"ready\",\n      \"path\": \"<exact PNG output_path>\",\n      \"kind\": \"gnss_timeseries_plot\",\n      \"columns\": []\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nActive workspace root: D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\nWrite generated artifacts (files, charts, exports) inside the active workspace root using absolute paths so they stay with the session. Read inputs from wherever the user points you.\nWrites are only permitted under: D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects."}}}}

