 1000 ms cadence and the 5070-second (84.5-minute) observation window. Something like \"MTA1 Displacement Time Series - 1000 ms cadence, ~1.4 hour span\" would capture the key metadata.\n\nI have the profile data ready and can proceed with the plotting call. The input file path is confirmed as `D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`, and I'll save the output to the workspace root with a station-specific filename.\n\nThe data contains the necessary columns: `time` for the x-axis and `east`, `north`, `up` for the displacement components to plot."}}

