ly generated with cadence and time span metadata in title\n- The visualization displays displacement components (east, north, up) across the full time range with appropriate axis labels and formatting\n\nThe PNG artifact is ready at the specified output location with 2000 rows plotted from the available dataset. The three displacement components are rendered as separate time series on the same figure. Note that only the first 2000 rows were visualized rather than the complete 250,000-row file, and profile statistics derive from a 5,000-row sample rather than full-file analysis."}}

