fully satisfied through the complete pipeline. All four requirements have been executed and returned evidence:\n1. **Nearest station found:** MTA1 at 0.30 km (nearest of 72 ranked candidates) \u2713\n2. **Time-series CSV staged:** 250,000-row file ready for analysis \u2713  \n3. **Profile complete:** Scanned 250,000 rows; profiled 5,000-row sample showing displacement (east: \u22120.047 m mean, north: +0.045 m mean, up: +0.136 m mean) and uncertainties (0.033 m horizontal, 0.065 m vertical), 1000 ms cadence, ~1h 24m span, zero missing values in profile \u2713\n4. **PNG artifact created:** Displacement time-series plot rendered \u2713\n\nAll child experts (geospatial, data, analysis, visualization) have completed. The accumulated workflow_state contains all authoritative evidence: coordinates, station ID, staged data paths with source URLs, profile statistics with explicit scan-limited scope, and artifact path. Per the instructions: \"If the workflow is complete, delegate once to synthesis, then answer normally.\" Synthesis has been delegated to (status=completed, though its prose was procedurally focused). The typed workflow_state provides all grounded facts needed for final presentation."}}, "replay": true}

