  | 0.036   | 0.0330   |\n| sigUU (Vert)| 0.062   | 0.066   | 0.0651   |\n\n## Time Coverage & Cadence (Profiled Sample)\n- **Time range**: 1,733,184,000,000 to 1,733,189,070,000 milliseconds (Unix epoch)\n- **Profiled time span**: ~5,070 seconds (~1 hour 24 minutes)\n- **Observed cadence**: ~1,000 ms between adjacent samples\n- **Caveat**: Full-file time range, complete duration, and cadence verification remain unperformed.\n\n## Data Completeness\n- **Missing values in profiled rows**: 0\n- **Caveat**: Missing-value assessment applies to profiled rows only; full-file gap analysis not performed.\n\n## Station Suitability (Preliminary, Scan-Limited)\n- **Structure**: All required columns intact in profiled sample \u2713\n- **Uncertainty scale**: Horizontal (~0.033 m) and vertical (~0.065 m) uncertainty values span centimeter-to-decimeter range, consistent with typical GNSS instrument precision.\n- **Geospatial context**: Station MTA1 is one of 72 candidates in Los Angeles area network (bbox: \u2212118.67\u00b0 to \u2212118.16\u00b0W, 33.66\u00b0 to 34.34\u00b0N).\n- **Preliminary status**: Structurally sound; suitable for preliminary analysis pending full-file verification.\n\n## Critical Limitations\n\n1. **Statistics scope**: Min/max/mean values are from 5,000 profiled rows only; do not generalize to the full 250,000-row file.\n2. **Time and cadence**: Time range and observed cadence describe the profiled sample; full-file duration and complete-scan cadence verification remain unverified.\n3. **Missing-value assessment**: Counts apply to profiled rows only; no full-file continuity or gap-pattern analysis performed.\n4. **Quality flags**: qChannel metadata is present but not decoded; no quality-threshold interpretation supplied.\n5. **Noise and continuity**: No per-epoch noise assessment, data continuity checks, or quality thresholds applied.\n6. **Partial profiling**: Profile is scan-limited and partial by design; full-file statistical confirmation is needed before production-grade analysis.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nMTA1 data structure and sampled statistics support displacement work. However, full-file profiling (cadence verification, gap analysis, complete time-range confirmation, and continuity checks) is required to confirm suitability for production analysis. Parallel evaluation of network redundancy across the 72-station Los Angeles catalog is recommended to validate results and mitigate single-station risk.", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "metadata_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246, "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "status": "staged"}, "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 50, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved", "warnings": ["Default search radius of 50 km assumed; no explicit radius was specified in the request."]}, "pipeline_stage": "network_analysis_complete", "profile": {"status": "complete", "path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "scan_limited": true, "columns": ["time", "east", "north", "up", "sigEE", "sigNN", "sigUU", "qChannel"], "limitations": ["Numeric statistics computed on 5,000 profiled rows only; do not generalize to full 250,000-row file", "Time range and cadence observed in profiled sample only; full-file duration and cadence not verified",