.058 | 0.045 |\n| Up | 0.051 | 0.224 | 0.136 |\n\n*Horizontal & Vertical Uncertainties (1\u03c3, meters):*\n| Uncertainty | Min | Max | Mean |\n|-------------|-------|-------|--------|\n| \u03c3_East | 0.032 | 0.035 | 0.033 |\n| \u03c3_North | 0.032 | 0.036 | 0.033 |\n| \u03c3_Up | 0.062 | 0.066 | 0.065 |\n\n*Time Coverage (Profiled Span):*\n- **Epoch range:** 1733184000000\u20131733189070000 ms (Unix)\n- **Duration:** ~5,070 seconds (\u22481 hour 24 minutes)\n- **Observed cadence:** 1,000 ms | **Missing values:** 0 (in profiled sample)\n\n**Visualization Artifact:**\n- **Path:** `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1_displacement.png`\n- **Content:** Three-component displacement time-series (east, north, up) with legends\n- **Rows plotted:** 2,000 (leading rows) | **Cadence shown:** 1,000 ms | **Span:** 1h 24m\n\n**Critical Limitations:**\n- **Profile scope:** Statistics from 5,000 profiled rows only; full-file min/max/mean unverified\n- **Full-file duration & cadence:** Time range describes profiled sample; continuous duration, complete cadence, and gap analysis remain unperformed\n- **Missing-value assessment:** Zero missing values in profiled rows only; full-file continuity not verified\n- **Plot coverage:** First 2,000 rows visualized; long-term trends across all 250,000 rows not shown\n- **Quality metadata:** qChannel flag values present but not decoded\n- **Verification pending:** Full-file statistical confirmation, complete gap analysis, and continuity verification required before production-grade analysis\n\n**Recommendation:**\nMTA1 data structure and sampled statistics support preliminary displacement studies. Full-file profiling (gap detection, complete time-range verification, cadence confirmation) and evaluation of network redundancy across the 72-station Los Angeles catalog recommended for production use.", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The user's request has been fully satisfied through the complete pipeline. All four requirements have been executed and returned evidence:\n1. **Nearest station found:** MTA1 at 0.30 km (nearest of 72 ranked candidates) \u2713\n2. **Time-series CSV staged:** 250,000-row file ready for analysis \u2713  \n3. **Profile complete:** Scanned 250,000 rows; profiled 5,000-row sample showing displacement (east: \u22120.047 m mean, north: +0.045 m mean, up: +0.136 m mean) and uncertainties (0.033 m horizontal, 0.065 m vertical), 1000 ms cadence, ~1h 24m span, zero missing values in profile \u2713\n4. **PNG artifact created:** Displacement time-series plot rendered \u2713\n\nAll child experts (geospatial, data, analysis, visualization) have completed. The accumulated workflow_state contains all authoritative evidence: coordinates, station ID, staged data paths with source URLs, profile statistics with explicit scan-limited scope, and artifact path. Per the instructions: \"If the workflow is complete, delegate once to synthesis, then answer normally.\" Synthesis has been delegated to (status=completed, though its prose was procedurally focused). The typed workflow_state provides all grounded facts needed for final presentation."}}, "replay": true}

